---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { link } from '../lib/link';
---
<Base title="About Us » Berojgar Engineer" description="Bijan Aryal is an IT Support Engineer in Nepal with 3+ years in fintech and finance, a first division Computer Engineering graduate of Kathmandu Engineering College, writing honest guidance on IT careers, Linux, Kubernetes and Loksewa preparation.">
  <section class="page">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h1 class="page-title">About Us</h1>
      <p>
        I am <strong>Bijan Aryal</strong>, an IT Support Engineer based in Nepal. I have worked in fintech and finance companies for over three years, supporting the systems that keep those businesses running day to day.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am a Computer Engineering graduate from <strong>Kathmandu Engineering College</strong>, where I passed with first division. Alongside my work, I am preparing for the <strong>Loksewa Computer Engineer and IT Officer</strong> examinations, and much of what I learn along the way ends up on this site.
      </p>
      <h2>What I Work With</h2>
      <p>
        My day-to-day work is on <strong>Linux servers and the command line</strong> — administering, troubleshooting and keeping production systems healthy. I also operate <strong>Kubernetes</strong> workloads, working with pods and deployments in containerised environments.
      </p>
      <h2>Why This Site Exists</h2>
      <p>
        My vision is to be a highly rated resource for freshers seeking to enter the IT industry. My mission is to solve the information asymmetry problem prevalent in IT careers in Nepal — the honest guidance I wish someone had given me when I was starting out.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have a question or would like to connect, please visit our <a href={link('/contact')}>contact page</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Join Our Community</h2>
      <p>
        Subscribe to my YouTube channel for updates: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@LoksewaComputerEngineeringPrep" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.youtube.com/@LoksewaComputerEngineeringPrep</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .page { padding: 50px 0 60px; }
  .narrow { width: 100%; max-width: 800px; }
  .page-title { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--c-text); }
  h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 26px 0 12px; color: var(--c-primary-dark); }
  p { line-height: 1.85; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  ul { margin: 0 0 16px 22px; line-height: 1.85; }
  a { color: var(--c-primary); text-decoration: underline; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page { padding: 32px 0 44px; }
    .page-title { font-size: 30px; }
    h2 { font-size: 20px; }
    p { line-height: 1.7; }
  }
</style>
